+# BP-087 demo/save artifact audit
+
+The asset-free fixture suite binds Protocol-15 demo framing and Quake savegame
+version 5. The Windows retail evidence performs two independent runs:
+
+1. load `demo1.dem`, `demo2.dem` and `demo3.dem` through the Quake filesystem;
+2. parse every frame and verify the resulting client protocol stream;
+3. initialize a live map, advance 64 deterministic frames and serialize a
+   version-5 savegame;
+4. parse and apply that save to a fresh server on the same map;
+5. reserialize and require both exact bytes and matching global/edict hashes.
+
+Only textual evidence is collected. Demo, save, PAK and other game-data bytes
+are never copied into the result archive.
+
+Contract: `artifact_compat_109_frozen_v1`, fingerprint `0x59531091`.
